# reject-transfer-widen — the transfer licenses `advise`, which is not in the
# consigning actor's mandate. An actor cannot hand on a purpose it was not
# itself given (§6); ill-formed at apply.
actor counsel mandate review
gate  release risk low consign vendorb grant counsel[work_product:low]
transfer work_product to vendorb within {review,advise}
cord release -> master
